// ─── What Kai has agreed to ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ── Retainers, in the client's currency ─────────────────────────────────────
// As in 01-agency (01a5), each is an invoice that the contract can only write as a receipt. Here the invoice is
// a claim in EUR or GBP, and what arrives is EUR or GBP, so nothing converts.

contract nordlicht-retainer with nordlicht
  4_200 EUR monthly on 12 into wise-bal #consulting     // ▸ German B2B: no VAT charged (reverse charge)

contract brightside-retainer with brightside
  3_100 GBP monthly on 15 into wise-bal #consulting

// ── Austin, until the end of February ───────────────────────────────────────

contract rent-austin with greenline-apts
  1_650 USD monthly on 1 from chase-checking #rent
  until 2026-02-28

// ── Lisbon, from the first of March ─────────────────────────────────────────
// The deposit is paid as a flow with `due` (journal/2026/03.ax): a claim on the landlord, which is what a
// tenant's deposit is. ? 04c5: that is the *same* thing §5's `deposit` names for a landlord, and this contract has
// none: two ways to say one thing, and no rule for which.

contract lisbon-rent with casa-alfama
  1_450 EUR monthly on 1 from wise-bal #rent
  from 2026-03-01 until 2027-02-28

contract cowork with lx-cowork
  180 EUR monthly on 2 from wise-bal
  from 2026-03-02
contract edp with edp
  about 62 EUR monthly on 20 from millennium #utilities
  from 2026-03-20
contract internet with nos
  39.99 EUR monthly on 8 from millennium
  from 2026-03-08

// ── Everything else ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/// Nomad health insurance: charged every four weeks.
contract health with safetywing
  56.28 USD every 4w from 2026-01-05 from visa #insurance

contract github with github
  4 USD monthly on 8 from visa
contract notion with notion
  10 USD monthly on 8 from visa
contract cloudflare with cloudflare
  20 USD monthly on 14 from visa

/// Federal estimates, for the year the money was earned. The fourth is due in January of the next.
/// ✗ 04a4: as in 01 and 02 (01a8): four installments that are not a cadence, the last one for the previous
/// year. §2 has `for 2025` on a flow; a contract has no `for the tax year`.
contract est-tax with irs
  3_100 USD yearly on 04-15, 06-15, 09-15, 01-15 from chase-checking #tax-paid

/// Weekly staking rewards on the ETH bonded at Kraken, credited on Fridays. The amount is the network's.
contract staking with kraken
  about 0.0015 ETH weekly on friday into kraken-stake #staking
